This Sunday 3-5 I will be at Montclair Brewery with a few of my artworks available for purchase! Come out to inquire about any of the works for sale and have a drink! Have you tried their pumpkin brew yet 🍻🎃? It’s delicious 😋! You can stop in and purchase a piece anytime they are open. Use the Venmo QR code posted on the wall and confirm with the bartender. Original paintings starting at $150! Great value for original art! 
