“Wild Fire”
36x36 Acrylic and Metallic Enamel 
See the specks of metallic enamel sparkle like the embers of a fire in the wind. In certain light you will catch gold, opal and bronze glimmers throughout the warm landscape of late autumn wildflowers.  Stop in to Montclair Brewery today to see it in person and imagine it in your space. Dm me for more price details and delivery options. 

